# Generated by ../checkpoints.py -- never checked in (see that file's
# own doc comment): an mgba raw .state is a full emulated-console memory
# snapshot and embeds real copyrighted ROM/game data directly, the exact
# kind of content this project's own "never check in a copyrighted ROM"
# rule keeps out of version control. The .png sanity-check screenshots
# are regenerated the same way and excluded for the same reason.
*.state
*.png
!.gitignore
